  "notes": "{汚染|おせん} refers to environmental or other forms of contamination.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Both transitive ({他動詞|たどうし}) and intransitive ({自動詞|じどうし})\n- Transitive: [noun]を{汚染|おせん}する\n- Intransitive: [noun]が{汚染|おせん}する\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {汚染|おせん}する (to pollute, contaminate)\n- {汚染|おせん}される (to become polluted)\n- 〜{汚染|おせん} (~ pollution/contamination)\n\nTYPES OF POLLUTION:\n- {大気|たいき}{汚染|おせん} (air pollution)\n- {水質|すいしつ}{汚染|おせん} (water pollution)\n- {土壌|どじょう}{汚染|おせん} (soil contamination)\n- {放射能|ほうしゃのう}{汚染|おせん} (radioactive contamination)\n- {海洋|かいよう}{汚染|おせん} (ocean pollution)\n\nCOMPOUND WORDS:\n- {汚染|おせん}{物質|ぶっしつ} (pollutant)\n- {汚染|おせん}{地域|ちいき} (contaminated area)\n- {汚染|おせん}{源|げん} (source of pollution)",
